{"screen_name": "kokorominton", "file": "kokorominton-5a28d7", "name": "心みんとん", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1857060980229849088/1MyTUctA.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/166972623/1750680061/1500x500", "description": "ゆめかわが好きなイラストレーター🦄💭*\n 見つけてくれてありがとう ┆\nLink🔗 ▷https://lit.link/kokorominton┆ \n⚠️無断改変、FAご本人様以外の無断転載、AI学習禁止❌", "total_works": 19, "scraped_works": 19, "first_seen": "2026-03-18T21:28:46.282861+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-21T03:07:35.566503+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 26000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-18T21:28:46.282861+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-18T21:28:46.282861+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 26000, "correction": 10000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 26000, "max": 26000}, "correction": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/kokorominton", "name": "kokorominton"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/kokorominton", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/1772780", "name": "1772780"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@kokorominton/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c548ff1d358de53d196a9eb04d536462", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c548ff1d358de53d196a9eb04d536462, https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82b50c0258da1ff76608e605c6feb670 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18209a3e20b28b12c9661e507b798c74 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I was deeply moved when I saw your work, Canari, the other day. Therefore, regarding this request, I would like to ask for Gwynn (Janapese name is ムク) , who also appears in \"Legends: Z-A\". She's petite and adorable, yet carries a hint of eeriness. Then again, that might be natural for a Ghost-type user. I feel she's the perfect fit for your expression. I look forward to seeing your Kawaii illustrations again.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694726028b6f3e38f54ca00bc4866374", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694726028b6f3e38f54ca00bc4866374, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21e40949f4b84491cf2ac89f7a288316 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6e4ba8ed66cef7d2913ce5f0c02cabb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I love your Kawaii illustrations and am happy to be able to commission you again like this. Now, what I would like to commission you to do is Rosalina from the Super Mario series. She has starry features and I am curious to see how shimmering and beautiful she will be in your works. She has a wide variety of outfits, for example, a biker suit(Mario Kart), an Aurora Dress(Mario Kart Tour), and a Cat Suit(Super Mario 3D World), but we leave it up to you to choose which one you would like to wear. However, if I may venture to tell you, I prefer the Aurora Dress(Mario Kart Tour). I look forward to seeing your more refined work again.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b1ab2b5/uploads/origins/e66c2468-c074-4c48-8737-dcf38db32a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22a4700a4b7ce7949e7537fcac483e8d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b1ab2b5/uploads/origins/e66c2468-c074-4c48-8737-dcf38db32a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22a4700a4b7ce7949e7537fcac483e8d, https://si.imgix.net/8b1ab2b5/uploads/origins/e66c2468-c074-4c48-8737-dcf38db32a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a22d0762db2ab7f3e3ceff92e29b9c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b1ab2b5/uploads/origins/e66c2468-c074-4c48-8737-dcf38db32a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=346d85a34583ae620aa395fd0c8f794b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I am extremely delighted to be able to commission you again. I would like to commission you my recent favourite Kawaii girl, Hiro Shinosawa from Gakuen Idolmaster. If you are producing Hiro-chang in the Gakuen Idolmaster, for better or worse, she will always leave a strong impression. She has a variety of outfits, I particularly like the Fancy Dress Party outfit, but you can choose whichever outfit you like. I trust your judgement. I look forward to seeing your Kawaii illustrations again.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a85a95758d4affb4597f4fc2196d78ba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a85a95758d4affb4597f4fc2196d78ba, https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e8d7f30c866c6277ac2f01f73bcb3fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6a6deb24fb0f6b532b1f95c9415b355 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. If you give priority to another client's request, you can ignore my request. This time I would like to request Kana Arima from \"OSHI NO KO\" to be drawn by you. She is both an actress and an IDOL singer. Also, Kana-chang is a \"Tsundere\" girl. I think the subtleties of expression in the character you draw are so wonderful that I think you can portray her delicately and endearingly. I apologize to you for being a serial requester, but if you feel up to it, I would like you to take me up on the request.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab00662d/uploads/origins/d6852ccc-5496-4b0c-996a-a979baab5791?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31ac59cb9d8e6c80f3445cd7bdbbac09", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab00662d/uploads/origins/d6852ccc-5496-4b0c-996a-a979baab5791?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31ac59cb9d8e6c80f3445cd7bdbbac09, https://si.imgix.net/ab00662d/uploads/origins/d6852ccc-5496-4b0c-996a-a979baab5791?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4603ee21577953f31fa5d74722a74d23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab00662d/uploads/origins/d6852ccc-5496-4b0c-996a-a979baab5791?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fc8f2b51df0797c9bb66be9a0779831 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. This time I would like to commission you to be one of my favourite girls these days, Bocchi-chang(Hitori Gotoh) from \"Bocchi the Rock!\". She has pink hair, which you will probably like. I look forward to seeing your wonderful artworks again.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4df1fad/uploads/origins/c5998e7e-bddc-43f3-81e6-158200963b00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09dc92673f308f75c9b8fd1278487d6b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4df1fad/uploads/origins/c5998e7e-bddc-43f3-81e6-158200963b00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09dc92673f308f75c9b8fd1278487d6b, https://si.imgix.net/e4df1fad/uploads/origins/c5998e7e-bddc-43f3-81e6-158200963b00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=103193538d92636360682e53fe5f47cc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4df1fad/uploads/origins/c5998e7e-bddc-43f3-81e6-158200963b00?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d266e682913d63ee24912bafde6def83 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I wanted to make a request to you during this commission-free campaign. I wanted to see your \"Tsundere\" girl again. Therefore, what I would like to request from you is Mikoto Misaka from A Certain Scientific Railgun. I would like you to draw a cool and dynamic illustration of Mikoto Misaka activating her railgun ability. I look forward to seeing your wonderful artworks again.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c015a333/uploads/origins/723966ae-0864-4932-9a49-f4b725b45221?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d67c232a59e28023e68ef7f606fe37fb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c015a333/uploads/origins/723966ae-0864-4932-9a49-f4b725b45221?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d67c232a59e28023e68ef7f606fe37fb, https://si.imgix.net/c015a333/uploads/origins/723966ae-0864-4932-9a49-f4b725b45221?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5784593d0d17375cc414bd7e606b24e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c015a333/uploads/origins/723966ae-0864-4932-9a49-f4b725b45221?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76ee128f33fc41ac8d6b94b9ae0c82b0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I am so happy to request from you again. I want your cute and \"Tsundere\" Fuyuko Mayuzumi from \"Idol Master Shiny Colors\". You can choose and draw any of the costume if you like. I look forward to seeing your wonderful artworks.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a94dd133/uploads/origins/55b633a2-b564-42fe-b925-ecf344cee797?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=186b40a9fcb87b9a084675041f314d6e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a94dd133/uploads/origins/55b633a2-b564-42fe-b925-ecf344cee797?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=186b40a9fcb87b9a084675041f314d6e, https://si.imgix.net/a94dd133/uploads/origins/55b633a2-b564-42fe-b925-ecf344cee797?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eded3c57e6e5637a87b08c2194eba2ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a94dd133/uploads/origins/55b633a2-b564-42fe-b925-ecf344cee797?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c81df1d2b4ca08a31be9ba0a4f796106 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "また、彼女は「墓場」でのお茶会のイメージが強いのですが、どのシーンを描くかはお任せしたいと思います。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc75d8b4/uploads/origins/e916cbe6-c80d-4a2b-a9d4-1ea057163dc7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop